Rejoin soft-wrapped rows when copying a fullscreen selection.

Selection copy turns every rendered row into a hard newline, so a URL or command wrapped by a
narrow window pastes in broken pieces. Upstream declined it (earendil-works/pi#8019, #11660).
wrapTextWithAnsi() now tags each continuation row with a zero-width APC holding the whitespace
the wrap dropped; copy glues tagged rows back on, and applyLineResets() strips the tag before output.

